<title>CANADA: SLM International Inc year loss narrows.</title>
<headline>SLM International Inc year loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr loss		 NA     loss	    NA</p>
<p> Oper net loss	  $18,700     loss     $51,900</p>
<p> Revs		     140,300		  161,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Per share results not given. Company's previous common canceled by bankruptcy reorganization and 6.5 million new shares issued.</p>
<p>1995 loss excludes loss of $25.6 million from disposition of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The company said it had an operating loss of $2.2 million vs $21.5 million, including $4 million of charges in 1996 and $15.5 million of charges in 1995.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
